51,2,4,talk,Victoria,,I concur. The study commons respects the timetable and the booking data. It is the logical choice.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,George,,I agree. It does not add to the staff burden. It is the responsible choice for the people who maintain it.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Mizuki,,I agree. It avoids the weather and survey risks. It is the safest bet for the schedule.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,I agree. It avoids the cost overruns of mechanical plant. It is the only option that respects the budget reality.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
